  "summary": "WYOMISSING, Pa. --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Mar. 30, 2026-- PENN Entertainment, Inc. (Nasdaq: PENN) announced today that it will release its 2026 first quarter financial results at 7:00 a.m. ET on Thursday, April 23, 2026, followed by a conference call and simultaneous webcast at 8:00 a.m. ET.",
